2 CONT
2 CONT [ [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_sexually_active_popes#cite_note-15 15] ] Kirsch, Johann Peter (1910). "Pope John XVII (XVIII)" . In Herbermann, Charles (ed.). Catholic Encyclopedia. Vol. 8. New York: Robert Appleton Compa
