2 CONC 'King Stjepan I'''] & his wife [https://www.geni.com/people/Marija-Praska/6000000205178471981 '''Maria'''] had [three] children, they have only two chilldren: [https://www.geni.com/people/Kre%C5%A1imir-IV-Trpimirovi%C4%87-of-Croat
2 CONC ia/6000000010576268226 '''Petar Krešimir IV''' (Veliki)] and [https://www.geni.com/people/Gojislav-Trpimirovi%C4%87/6000000010589044966 '''Gojislav II''']. Also wrong to the according to Fine, the wife of King Stjepan was from Ven
