2 CONC awn Dalmatian, 1846, 20). Among the masterpieces is subtracted occasional song Trstenik pastijer the joy of 1703 (Proceedings of the island of Korcula, 1972, 2), inspired by the defense of Dubrovnik in delicate historical situatio
2 CONC ns. With insight and current European developments (War of Spanish heritage), the song highlights the absurdity of conflict and wars, and it K. reflexive and ornate Baroque and Arcadian interwoven elements. He also wrote occasiona
2 CONC l friends, the last in the tragic death of V. Bujović 1709 (tearful memories of the death of Mr. Prince prisvitloga Vyska Bujović), in which the praises of his ventures, but expresses an objection and the people of Perast committe
