2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Note 1''': Descendant of the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spani_family Albanian Spani family] of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Drisht Drivasto], see profile of: [https://www.geni.com/people/Nik%C5%A1a-Span/600000020513587089
2 CONC 2 Nikša Span]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Note 2''': Seems he was not a same person [https://www.enciklopedija.hr/clanak/spanic-nikola Nikola Španić], Španić, Nikola. Hrvatska enciklopedija, mrežno izdanje. Leksikografski zavod Miroslav Krleža, 2013. - 2024. <https://w
2 CONC ww.enciklopedija.hr/clanak/spanic-nikola>
