1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Updated from [http://www.myheritage.com/research/collection-1/myheritage-family-trees?itemId=128089971-17-6699&action=showRecord&indId=externalindividual-9b3ca7dfc8049695d5713f18064e1f06&mrid=1d4b4b053d07afbb6773
2 CONC 1cbc5d21d968 MyHeritage Family Trees] via mother [http://www.geni.com/profile-34666030498 Maddalena Nutrizio (born Jura)] by [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Nov 1 2014, 5:59:45 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT Šimun Nutrizio 1773. godine postaje Conte Veneto. rodonačelnik obitelji Nutrizio u Trogiru. Rod Nutrizio doselio se u Trogir iz Poljica u 16. st. Ranije su se zvali Babić.
2 CONT
2 CONT A descendant of the Babićs from Poljica called Nutrizio, a genus with a very old tree that begins with the so-called prince Ilija Babić in 1155. Captain Šimun Babić, then already called only Nutrizio, was given the Venetian title 
2 CONC of conte on December 22, 1773. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Napomena''': Nije bio rođen u Poljica (Poljička Republika) već u Trogiru.
