1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ivan or Zanetto from Trogir, full name Ivan Erik Nutrizio, is a descendant of the Babićs from Poljica called Nutrizio, a genus with a very old tree that begins with the so-called prince Ilija Babić in 1155. Ivan's 
2 CONC grandfather, Captain Šimun Babić, then already called only Nutrizio, was given the Venetian title of conte on December 22, 1773. The name of Ivan Nutrizio, son of Petrov, is recorded in genealogy. I.BABIĆ–A.DUPLANČIĆ,Povijesttr
2 CONC ogirskeobiteljiBabić-Nutrizio,GrađaiprilozizapovijestDalmacije, sv. 11, Split, 1990., str. 331–333.
2 CONT
2 CONT J. CELIĆ, Stanovništvo Omiša prema popisu iz 1806. godine, Rad. Zavoda povij. znan. HAZU Zadru, sv. 48/2006., str. 511–556.
2 CONT
