2 CONT **'''''Mletački katastar Pirovca (Zlosela) iz 1752. godine''' (Venetian cadastre of Pirovac (Zlosela) from 1752)'' by Tea Perinčić, Pages 7 and 8. 
2 CONT *** "Obitelj Draganić-Vrančić (tal. Draganich-Veranzio), koja se pod objedinjenim naslovom obaju prezimena javlja nakon 1737. Osnivač zajedničke obitelji je grof dr. Frano Draganić Vrančić, padovanski student, doktor obaju prava, 
2 CONC dugogodišnji odvjetnik u Veneciji i Šibeniku, šibenski i skradinski veleposjednik i jedini gospodar Zlosela (Pirovca). On i njegova supruga groica Margarita Vrančić nakon njihove ženidbe (1737.) Nose oba prezimena, a nakon smrti M
2 CONC argaritinog oca, grofa Antona Vrančića, 1743. godine to je i ugovorom veriicirano. To se odnosi i na njihove potomke. Frano i Margarita imali su 6 sinova, od kojih je samo jedan, Nikola Mihael imao potomke. Dr. Frano Draganić (171
2 CONC 1.-1799.) koji je, 1737. godine oženio posljednju pripadnicu obitelji Vrančić, Margaritu Vrančić (1715.-1776.) imao je devetero djece: najstariji Petar Jeronim (1738.-1821.), zatim Paškval Anton (1739.-1744.), Nikola Mihael (1740.
2 CONC -1805.), Elena (1741.-1776.), Anton (1742.-1780.), Franja Marija (1744.-1817.), Kazimir (1746.-1820.), Faust (1749.-1829.) i Marketa Marija (1750. -1751.)."
2 CONT ***(google translation) "The Draganić-Vrančić family (Italian: Draganich-Veranzio), which appears under the combined title of both surnames after 1737. The founder of the joint family is Count Dr. Frano Draganić Vrančić, a student
2 CONC  from Padua.  Doctor of both laws, a long-time lawyer in Venice and Šibenik, the lord of Šibenik and Skradin and the only lord of Zlosel (Pirovac). He and his wife Countess Margarita Vrančić after their marriage (1737) they bear b
2 CONC oth surnames, and after the death of Margarita's father, Count Anton Vrančić, in 1743, it was also by contract verified. This also applies to their descendants. Frano and Margarita had 6 sons, of which only one, Nikola Mihael had 
2 CONC descendants. dr. Frano Draganić (1711-1799) who, in 1737, married the last a member of the Vrančić family, Margarita Vrančić (1715-1776), had nine children: the eldest Petar Jeronim (1738-1821), then Paškval Anton (1739-1744), Nik
2 CONC ola Mihael (1740-1805), Elena (1741-1776), Anton (1742-1780), Franja Marija (1744-1817), Casimir (1746-1820), Faust (1749-1829) and Marketa Maria (1750 -1751))"
